      "text": "$\\mathbf{u} \\times \\mathbf{v} + \\mathbf{u} = \\mathbf{w},$ so $\\mathbf{w} \\cdot \\mathbf{u} = (\\mathbf{u} \\times \\mathbf{v} + \\mathbf{u}) \\cdot \\mathbf{u} = \\mathbf{u} \\cdot \\mathbf{u} + \\mathbf{v} \\cdot \\mathbf{u} = 1 + \\sin \\theta,$ where $\\theta$ is the angle between $\\mathbf{u}$ and $\\mathbf{v}.$\n\nSo $\\mathbf{w} \\times \\mathbf{u} = \\mathbf{v}.$\n\n$\\mathbf{v} \\cdot (\\mathbf{u} \\times \\mathbf{w}) = \\mathbf{v} \\cdot \\mathbf{w} (\\mathbf{u} \\times \\mathbf{u}) = \\mathbf{v} \\cdot \\mathbf{w} \\cdot 0 = 0.$\n\n$\\boxed{\\mathbf{V} \\cdot (\\mathbf{U} \\times \\mathbf{W}) = \\mathbf{V} \\cdot \\mathbf{W} (\\mathbf{U} \\times \\mathbf{U}) = \\mathbf{V} \\cdot \\mathbf{W} \\cdot 0 = \\boxed{0}}$",
